        "narrative": "<p>Lake whitefish and northern pike are present in above average numbers; white sucker and rock bass are present in average numbers; cisco, yellow perch, and walleye are present in below average numbers. Bluegill, largemouth bass, and black crappie are also present. Whitefish, rock bass, and largemouth bass were observed for the first time during this assessment. Cisco sizes range from 9. Sizes are above average, and reproduction appears good. All four walleye captured were from stocked year classes. Growth appears to be good initially, then slows down. </p>",
